{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan <The S-Classes That I Raised>\n\nBatas Pertumbuhan, Rank 1.\n\nVerdan, seorang peneliti yang tidak memiliki bakat sebagai penyihir, bercita-cita untuk mencapai puncak Magic Tower melalui kecerdasannya yang jenius.\n\nNamun, setelah menarik perhatian Master Tower, ia dijadikan salah satu subjek eksperimen tersebut.\n\nSetelah bertahun-tahun menanggung penghinaan dan keputusasaan selama tujuh tahun, Verdan akhirnya mulai bergerak, bertekad untuk menembus batas dirinya sendiri menggunakan teori-teori yang ia kembangkan dan sumber kekuatan Magic Tower!","alternative_title":"한계 찢는 천재마법사","author":"Plankton","artist":"Kim Hyunjun","chapters":[{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"f5ab4b5f-2d9f-4842-b200-757e6bc71501","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-06-27"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"e6308577-25bc-4fc5-94bf-a83fc82cdd8a","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-05-22"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"0203afcf-2cb8-4693-afaa-c6a02223a0be","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-05-21"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"cab56d99-71ab-435b-9edd-b9e0a39ea5cd","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"f2de4489-6030-41c8-b650-6b62bffde30a","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"243620ba-dce8-4ae4-96aa-757b741b8477","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"f2cfe4c9-ef64-4bee-8985-a4fbfee87300","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-04-17"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"84fdba6b-fca0-437d-b595-e4072aca26b8","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-04-17"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"1f33fa46-4e38-49b3-ba9d-a8be52ccb15f","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-04-10"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"26a447bf-da1c-4137-9744-9f0f3244a101","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-04-05"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"fccd1a7f-4778-45c9-899b-3227156fd8e7","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-03-15"},{"number":"51",